==English==
[[File:Cattle eating grass through barbed wire fence.jpg|right|thumb|A cow, kneeling to eat grass on the other side of a barbed wire fence.]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|the grass is always greener}}
* {{l|en|the grass is always greener on the other side of the fence}}
* {{l|en|the grass is always greener on the other side of the road}}

===Proverb===
{{en-proverb}}

# The [[circumstance]]s of [[others]] seem more [[desirable]] than one's own but [[in reality]] often are not.

